New CSS:
```
/* ---------- 登录页 ---------- */
.login-wrap { min-height: 100vh; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr; align-items: stretch; }
.login-brand { position: relative; overflow: hidden; background: linear-gradient(150deg,#3d54ff 0%, #6a4dff 55%, #9d4dff 100%); color: #fff; padding: 60px 54px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; }
.login-brand::before, .login-brand::after { content: ""; position: absolute; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(255,255,255,.10); }
.login-brand::before { width: 420px; height: 420px; top: -140px; right: -120px; }
.login-brand::after { width: 280px; height: 280px; bottom: -120px; left: -80px; }
.login-brand .logo { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .3px; }
.login-brand .logo .mark { width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.2); backdrop-filter: blur(4px); display: grid; place-items: center; }
.login-brand h1 { font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.25; margin: 18px 0 10px; font-weight: 800; }
.login-brand p { opacity: .9; max-width: 420px; }
.login-brand .features { display: grid; gap: 12px; margin-top: 20px; }
.login-brand .features div { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.12); padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 12px; backdrop-filter: blur(4px); font-size: 14px; }
.login-brand .features .dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: #b7ffb7; box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(183,255,183,.2); }

.login-side { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 40px 24px; background: #f7f8fc; }
.login-card { width: 100%; max-width: 420px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: 0 14px 44px rgba(28,36,56,.10); padding: 34px 34px 30px; }
.login-card h2 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 25px; font-weight: 800; }
.login-card .sub { color: var(--ink-soft); margin: 0 0 26px; font-size: 14.5px; }
```

Wait — the left panel `.login-brand` has `justify-content: space-between` with 3 children: logo, middle text block, and the footer "演示系统 · 数据存于本地". Good (restoring as before).

Now the media query — I earlier changed it to `.login-bg`/`.login-card`. I need to update it back to `.login-wrap` / `.login-brand`. Let me check the media query block current state (lines ~218+).

Actually I earlier set:
```
@media (max-width: 820px) {
  .login-bg { padding: 28px 16px; }
  .login-card { padding: 28px 22px 22px; }
  .stats {...}
  ...
}
```
I need to change `.login-bg` and `.login-card` (login padding) back to `.login-wrap { grid-template-columns:1fr }` and `.login-brand { display:none }` and `.login-side { padding:28px 16px }`. Let me update the media query.

Now the `.input-wrap` and `.in-ico` styles — add them. And update `.field input` to work within `.input-wrap`. The existing `.field input` has `width:100%; padding:12px 14px;...`. With icon prefix, I'll add `padding-left: 40px` when inside `.input-wrap`. Let me add:
```
.input-wrap { position: relative; }
.input-wrap input { padding-left: 42px !important; }
.in-ico { position: absolute; left: 14px; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); color: #aab2c6; font-size: 16px; pointer-events: none; }
```
But `!important` is ugly. Better: since `.field input` has `padding:12px 14px`, and `.input-wrap input` I can set `padding-left:42px`. Specificity: `.input-wrap input` (0,1,1) vs `.field input` (0,1,1) — equal specificity, later rule wins. If I put `.input-wrap input` AFTER `.field input` in the CSS, it wins. So no need for !important. But to be safe, I'll add it after. Actually `.field input, .field textarea, .field select` selector. `.input-wrap input` is more specific? `.field input` = 1 class + 1 type = (0,1,1). `.input-wrap input` = (0,1,1). Equal → order matters. I'll place `.input-wrap input` later in the file. Fine.

Let me now also improve demo-accounts buttons slightly? They're fine. I'll keep them but maybe update text.

Let me now write the edits.

Edit 1: Replace login CSS block (lines 31-68).
Edit 2: Update media query.
Edit 3: Add `.input-wrap`/`.in-ico` CSS. I'll append after `.field` block or after `.btn` block. Let me add it right after the `.field .err` rule (line ~56 in original, but now shifted). Let me just add after `.demo-accounts .p:hover` (end of login-related CSS around line ~85). Actually simplest: add after `.sub` line within the login block I'm writing, i.e., include `.input-wrap`/`.in-ico` in the same new block. Yes, I'll include them in the CSS replacement block.

Edit 4: Update renderLogin JS template to split + icon inputs.

